    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "Spells (cauldron)",
        "content": "Each card shows one ingredient: Snake (green), Bat (purple) or Lizard’s leg (red). Cast a spell with the ingredients in your cauldron:\n• Snake + Bat: Draw 1 card. One of your fighters recovers 1 health.\n• Snake + Lizard’s leg: Move any fighter up to 3 spaces.\n• Lizard’s leg + Bat: Deal 1 damage to a fighter that shares a zone with any of your fighters.\n• Snake + Lizard’s leg + Bat: Gain 1 action."
      },
      {
        "title": "Cauldron",
        "content": "Put your played and discarded cards on the cauldron (beside your deck) instead of your discard pile; when you cast a spell, move them all to your discard pile."
      },
      {
        "title": "Three sisters",
        "content": "The Wayward Sisters are three heroes of 6 health each, each with her own health dial; a defeated Sister leaves the board and you lose only when the last one falls. An effect on \"your hero\" affects the Sister you choose. Here: the hero is one Sister and the other two are the \"Wayward Sister\" sidekicks, each with her own 6-health counter."
      }
    ]
